Test data
---------

Every script, payload, IMEI and value in the tests and the example of this
module is a made-up demo value.

The nested test-only module ttn (ttn/, its own go.mod; nothing imports it
and it is not part of this module) runs device makers' payload codecs and
their examples from TheThingsNetwork/lorawan-devices
(https://github.com/TheThingsNetwork/lorawan-devices, commit
900afb52024f795f073ee4192d845af12d2168d0). None of those files is included
here: the test fetches them at test time from that commit, when
SIGMA_JSCODEC_TTN is set, and checks them against the SHA-256 sums in
ttn/testdata/files.sha256 (a list of upstream paths and sums, no content).
The codecs belong to the respective device makers (adeunis, Browan,
Decentlab, Dragino, Elsys, MClimate, Milesight IoT, Netvox, SenseCAP,
Tektelic, Watteco) and The Things Network Foundation; see
ttn/testdata/SOURCE.txt.

The ttn module also uses gopkg.in/yaml.v3 (MIT and Apache-2.0) to read
the codec YAML files.
